  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "In a bowl, mash the beans; add 1 cup salsa. Place five tortillas on ungreased baking sheets; spread with bean mixture. Sprinkle with cheese; top with the remaining tortillas.",
      "group": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake at 400 degrees F for 10-15 minutes or until crisp and heated through. Cut into wedges. Serve with sour cream and remaining salsa.",
      "group": null
